From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mckenna654 <mckenna654@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:33:20 +1100
Subject: fix: picture battle menu fills the whole message box; one attack
 button when there is one attack

The menu borrowed Oak's window, which is two tiles narrower than the message box
and shares its tile memory, so the box's end columns showed scraps of the menu.
It now has a window of its own with the message box's exact footprint.
SPECIAL is left out when it would be the same move as ATTACK.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CNqSDphYuD2Aqe9TExdQMP

